<title>UK: INSIGHT - Gold shaky, seeks short-term direction.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Gold shaky, seeks short-term direction.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   317.80/8.30 *  313.60 * 323.00 *    26 * 321.39 * 333.63</p>
<p> SILVER   4.30/4.32 *    4.23 *   4.40 *    31 *   4.39 *   4.63</p>
<p> PLAT   400.50/3.50 *  394.00 * 410.00 *    45 * 404.70 * 420.50</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 16--------------</p>
<p>Gold is vulnerable to further downside pressure after recording more losses on Tuesday, but some analysts said a short-term recovery may be in store.</p>
<p>Silver should consolidate in a $4.23 to $4.40 range before resuming on a downward path.</p>
